  "content": "\n\n#### 此资源包为工具的附魔光效增添了<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>发光效果</strong>,</span>使其外观更加鲜艳时尚。\n\n![Sinnelar - 附魔光效 Minecraft 资源包展示（含 Hold My Items 模组）](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-with-hold-my-items-mod.webp)\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-bow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弓箭矢发光动画\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-crossbow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弩箭矢发光动画\" width=\"50%\">\n<br>\n\n此资源包完全兼容**<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">原版 Minecraft 1.21.4 - 26.2</span>**\n\n**附魔工具列表：**\n- 剑\n- 斧\n- 镐\n- 铲\n- 锄\n- 长矛\n- 战锤 3D\n- 弓\n- 弩\n- 钓鱼竿\n- 三叉戟 (1.21.4+)\n- 盾牌 (1.21.4+)\n\n**<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">1.21.4 以下版本需安装 CIT Resewn<br></span>**\n\n[**<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/ui/b-ct-d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"177\"></span>**](https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn)\n\n**鸣谢：**\n- 是的，本作品灵感源自&nbsp;<strong>Actions & Stuff\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3122\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/sinnelar-affiliates/sparked-host-promo-code-2026-minecraft-sinnelar.webp\" alt=\"Sparked Host 2026 促销码 - 使用代码 Sinnelar 享受 Minecraft 服务器托管 25% 折扣\" width=\"100%\">\n  </a>\n</div>",
